<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia says suspends new dealings with Singapore.</title>
<headline>Malaysia says suspends new dealings with Singapore.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia said on Wednesday it was suspending fresh bilateral dealings with Singapore, the national news agency Bernama said.</p>
